---
title: Order fulfilment
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(236,236,255) Storefront
        actor C as Customer
        participant W as Web shop
    end
    box rgb(255,245,220) Backend
        participant O as Orders
        participant DB@{ "type": "database" }
        participant Q@{ "type": "queue", "alias": "Events" }
    end
    C->>+W: Place order
    W->>+O: POST /orders
    O->>DB: INSERT order
    critical Reserve stock
        O->>DB: UPDATE inventory
    option Out of stock
        O-->>W: 409 Conflict
    end
    rect rgba(0, 128, 255, 0.12)
        par Notify
            O-)Q: order.created
        and Charge
            create participant P as Payments
            O->>+P: charge card
            P-->>-O: approved
            destroy P
            O-xP: close session
        end
    end
    loop Every 5s until shipped
        W->>O: GET /orders/42
        Note right of O: status polling
    end
    O-->>-W: 201 Created
    W-->>-C: Confirmation e-mail
    Note over C,W: Customer is happy
